#: data/io.github.Petru101.Ferret.desktop:4
msgid "Find and change values in your games"
msgstr "查找并修改游戏中的数值"

#. Translators: search words for the app, each ending with a semicolon.
#: data/io.github.Petru101.Ferret.desktop:10
msgid "cheat;trainer;memory;game;"
msgstr "修改器;作弊;内存;游戏;cheat;trainer;"

#: src/bar.rs:27
msgid ""
"The box is outside the game picture (the window got smaller?): capture again "
"and pick it again."
msgstr "框在游戏画面之外(窗口变小了?):请重新截取画面并重新选择。"

#: src/bar.rs:31
msgid ""
"The box doesn't look like a bar (one colour from one end, maybe another "
"after it): draw it close around the bar."
msgstr ""
"这个框看起来不像进度条(从一端开始是一种颜色,后面可能是另一种):请把框紧贴着进"
"度条画。"

#: src/bar.rs:36
msgid "The box isn't long and thin like a bar."
msgstr "这个框不像进度条那样细长。"

#: src/bar.rs:492
msgid ""
"Those look like icons, but none of them looks full: pick them while at least "
"one is full."
msgstr "看起来是图标,但没有一个是满的:请在至少有一个满的时候选择它们。"

#. Translators: headings and labels of an RPG Maker game's numbers in the Browse tab.
#: src/core.rs:367
msgid "Party"
msgstr "队伍"

#: src/core.rs:368
msgid "Global variables"
msgstr "全局变量"

#: src/core.rs:369
msgid "Gold"
msgstr "金钱"

#: src/core.rs:370
msgid "Steps"
msgstr "步数"

#: src/core.rs:371
msgid "Items"
msgstr "物品"

#: src/core.rs:372
msgid "Weapons"
msgstr "武器"

#: src/core.rs:373
msgid "Armor"
msgstr "防具"

#: src/core.rs:374
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "变量"

#: src/core.rs:375
msgid "Switches"
msgstr "开关"

#: src/core.rs:376
msgid "Player"
msgstr "玩家"

#: src/core.rs:377
msgid "Move speed"
msgstr "移动速度"

#: src/core.rs:378
msgid "Timer"
msgstr "计时器"

#: src/core.rs:379
msgid "Frames left"
msgstr "剩余帧数"

#: src/core.rs:818
msgid "To allow it until the next restart, run this in a terminal:"
msgstr "要在下次重启前允许,请在终端中运行:"

#: src/core.rs:820
msgid ""
"This lets any program you run read and change your other programs' memory."
msgstr "这会让你运行的任何程序都能读取和修改你其他程序的内存。"

#: src/core.rs:821
msgid "To keep it that way:"
msgstr "要一直保持这样:"

#: src/core.rs:822
msgid ""
"With your password, Ferret allows it for itself until you close it. The rest "
"of your system stays as it is."
msgstr ""
"输入你的密码后，Ferret 只为自己开启这项权限，直到你关闭它。系统的其他部分保持"
"不变。"

#: src/core.rs:827
msgid ""
"Your system only lets programs change the memory of programs they started "
"themselves (kernel.yama.ptrace_scope is 1). Windows games running through "
"Proton or Wine still work."
msgstr ""
"你的系统只允许程序修改它们自己启动的程序的内存(kernel.yama.ptrace_scope 为 "
"1)。通过 Proton 或 Wine 运行的 Windows 游戏仍然可以使用。"

#: src/core.rs:833
msgid ""
"Your system only lets administrators change other programs' memory "
"(kernel.yama.ptrace_scope is 2)."
msgstr ""
"你的系统只允许管理员修改其他程序的内存(kernel.yama.ptrace_scope 为 2)。"

#: src/core.rs:838
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Your system has turned off changing other programs' memory until it restarts "
"(kernel.yama.ptrace_scope is {scope})."
msgstr ""
"你的系统在重启之前禁止修改其他程序的内存(kernel.yama.ptrace_scope 为 "
"{scope})。"

#: src/core.rs:841
msgid "To allow it, run this in a terminal and restart:"
msgstr "要允许,请在终端中运行以下命令并重启:"

#: src/core.rs:1368
msgid ""
"Java game: Ferret only shows this value. Java moves its objects around, so a "
"later write could land in another object and crash the game. Save it from "
"the Browse tab, or find it again and save it: values the game names are "
"changed safely."
msgstr ""
"Java 游戏：Ferret 只显示这个值。Java 会移动它的对象，之后的写入可能落到另一个"
"对象里，导致游戏崩溃。请从“浏览”标签页保存它，或者重新找到它并保存：游戏有名"
"称的值可以安全地修改。"

#: src/core.rs:1506
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"its pointer paths disagree ({agree} of {total} lead to one place, "
"{elsewhere} to another)"
msgstr ""
"它的指针路径不一致({total} 条中有 {agree} 条指向一个位置,{elsewhere} 条指向另"
"一个位置)"

#: src/core.rs:1513
#, rust-format
msgid "only {agree} of its {n} pointer path leads anywhere"
msgid_plural "only {agree} of its {n} pointer paths leads anywhere"
msgstr[0] "它的 {n} 条指针路径中只有 {agree} 条能指向某处"

#: src/core.rs:1550
msgid ""
"The one place left put a test value back at once, like a copy the game "
"redraws its display from; the game may keep the value in a form Ferret can't "
"search for yet (a 2-byte number or an encoded one)."
msgstr ""
"最后剩下的位置立刻把测试值改了回去,像是游戏用来绘制显示的副本;游戏可能以 "
"Ferret 还不会搜索的形式保存这个数值(2 字节数或编码过的数)。"

#: src/core.rs:1759
msgid "attach to a game first"
msgstr "请先连接一个游戏"

#: src/core.rs:1928 src/core.rs:1941
#, rust-format
msgid "Ferret couldn't get permission: {why}"
msgstr "Ferret 未能获得权限：{why}"

#: src/core.rs:1935
msgid "The password dialog was closed before Ferret got permission."
msgstr "密码对话框在 Ferret 获得权限前被关闭了。"

#: src/core.rs:1938
msgid "Ferret didn't get permission."
msgstr "Ferret 未能获得权限。"

#: src/core.rs:1939
msgid ""
"On a Steam Deck, set a password first: open Konsole in desktop mode and run "
"this, then try again."
msgstr ""
"在 Steam Deck 上，请先设置密码：在桌面模式打开 Konsole，运行下面这条命令，然"
"后重试。"

#: src/core.rs:2078 src/core.rs:2100 src/core.rs:2831
msgid "the value needs a name"
msgstr "这个数值需要一个名字"

#: src/core.rs:2082
msgid "narrow down to exactly one address first"
msgstr "请先缩小到唯一一个地址"

#: src/core.rs:2117
msgid ""
"Ferret can't find this number again by its name, so it isn't saved. Find it "
"with a search instead."
msgstr "Ferret 无法按名称再次找到这个数字，因此没有保存。请改用搜索来找到它。"

#: src/core.rs:2164
#, rust-format
msgid "Ferret can't find it again by code or by name, and {why}"
msgstr "Ferret 无法通过代码或名称再次找到它,而且{why}"

#: src/core.rs:2314
msgid "no pointer from the game's own memory leads to it"
msgstr "游戏自身内存中没有指针指向它"

#: src/core.rs:2323
msgid "every pointer path to it changed within seconds"
msgstr "指向它的所有指针路径都在几秒内变了"

#: src/core.rs:2334
#, rust-format
msgid "the pointer scan failed: {e}"
msgstr "指针扫描失败:{e}"

#: src/core.rs:2426 src/core.rs:2490
#, rust-format
msgid "{name} isn't saved"
msgstr "{name} 没有保存"

#: src/core.rs:2431
#, rust-format
msgid "{name} is confirmed already"
msgstr "{name} 已经确认过了"

#: src/core.rs:2435
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{name} was saved in this run of the game, where all its pointer paths lead "
"to it: that proves nothing yet. Confirm it after restarting the game"
msgstr ""
"{name} 是在游戏的这次运行中保存的,这次运行中它的所有指针路径都指向它:这还证明"
"不了什么。请在重启游戏后再确认"

#: src/core.rs:2450
#, rust-format
msgid "none of {name}'s pointer paths lead anywhere now"
msgstr "{name} 的指针路径现在都不指向任何地方"

#: src/core.rs:2453 src/core.rs:2488
#, rust-format
msgid "{name} can't be confirmed: {why}"
msgstr "无法确认 {name}:{why}"

#: src/core.rs:2473
#, rust-format
msgid "{name} confirmed: Ferret finds it this way from now on"
msgstr "已确认 {name}:从现在起 Ferret 会这样找到它"

#: src/core.rs:2482
#, rust-format
msgid "{name} isn't in the game right now: load a save, then check it again"
msgstr "{name} 现在不在游戏中:请加载存档,然后再检查一次"

#: src/core.rs:2485
#, rust-format
msgid "{name} can't be confirmed: its name doesn't lead to one value ({why})"
msgstr "无法确认 {name}:它的名称没有指向唯一的数值({why})"

#: src/core.rs:2572
msgid ""
"it was imported and isn't checked yet. If the game shows the number Ferret "
"reads, say so in the Values tab"
msgstr ""
"它是导入的,还没有检查。如果游戏显示的数字和 Ferret 读到的一样,请在“数值”标签"
"页中说明"

#: src/core.rs:2575
#, rust-format
msgid "its name doesn't lead to one value ({why})"
msgstr "它的名称没有指向唯一的数值({why})"

#: src/core.rs:2579
msgid ""
"its pointer paths are guesses until a later run of the game confirms them"
msgstr "在游戏之后的某次运行确认之前,它的指针路径都只是猜测"

#: src/core.rs:2696
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{name}: it was imported and isn't checked yet. If the game shows the number "
"Ferret reads, say so in the Values tab"
msgstr ""
"{name}:它是导入的,还没有检查。如果游戏显示的数字和 Ferret 读到的一样,请在“数"
"值”标签页中说明"

#: src/core.rs:2702
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"its pointer paths aren't confirmed yet: confirm it in the Values tab if the "
"game shows its number, or find it again and save it as {name}"
msgstr ""
"它的指针路径还没有确认:如果游戏显示了它的数字,请在“数值”标签页中确认,或者重新"
"找到它并保存为 {name}"

#: src/core.rs:2748
msgid "Nothing is kept in range in this game"
msgstr "这个游戏中没有保持在范围内的数值"

#: src/core.rs:2810 src/core.rs:2836 src/core.rs:2894 src/core.rs:3193
#: src/core.rs:3799
#, rust-format
msgid "no saved value called {name}"
msgstr "没有名为 {name} 的已保存数值"

#: src/core.rs:2842
#, rust-format
msgid "{name} is the name of another saved value already"
msgstr "{name} 已经是另一个已保存数值的名字了"

#: src/core.rs:2898
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Ferret finds others like {name} through the game's code that changes it, and "
"doesn't know that code: find {name} again and save it while it changes in "
"the game"
msgstr ""
"Ferret 通过游戏中改变 {name} 的代码来找到同类的其他数值,但还不知道这段代码:请"
"重新找到 {name},并在它于游戏中变化时保存"

#: src/core.rs:2903
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{name} isn't found in this run yet: let it change in the game once, then try "
"again"
msgstr "本次运行中还没找到 {name}:先让它在游戏里变化一次,再试一次"

#: src/core.rs:2936
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Nothing else ran the code that changes {name} while Ferret watched. Use the "
"others in the game while it watches (your other powers, other units), then "
"click Done."
msgstr ""
"Ferret 观察期间,没有别的数值运行改变 {name} 的代码。请在它观察时在游戏里使用"
"其他的(你的其他能力、其他单位),然后点击“完成”。"

#: src/core.rs:2943
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Ferret found {n} more like {name}, but nothing next to the two tells them "
"apart, so it couldn't find each again: not saved"
msgid_plural ""
"Ferret found {n} more like {name}, but nothing next to them tells them "
"apart, so it couldn't find each one again: not saved"
msgstr[0] ""
"Ferret 又找到了 {n} 个和 {name} 同类的数值,但它们旁边没有能区分彼此的东西,所"
"以无法分别再次找到它们:未保存"

#: src/core.rs:3001
#, rust-format
msgid "The others like {name} are saved already"
msgstr "和 {name} 同类的其他数值已经保存过了"

#: src/core.rs:3003
#, rust-format
msgid "Found {n} more like {name}: {names}. It's kept in range like {name}."
msgid_plural ""
"Found {n} more like {name}: {names}. Each is kept in range like {name}."
msgstr[0] ""
"又找到了 {n} 个和 {name} 同类的数值:{names}。每个都像 {name} 一样保持在范围"
"内。"

#: src/core.rs:3010
#, rust-format
msgid "Found {n} more like {name}: {names}. It's in the Values tab."
msgid_plural "Found {n} more like {name}: {names}. They're in the Values tab."
msgstr[0] "又找到了 {n} 个和 {name} 同类的数值:{names}。它们在“数值”标签页中。"

#: src/core.rs:3034
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{name}: imported and not checked yet. On its card in the Values tab, click "
"“Yes, It Shows…” if the game shows that number"
msgstr ""
"{name}:已导入但还没有检查。如果游戏显示那个数字,请在“数值”标签页中它的卡片上"
"点击“是,显示了……”"

#: src/core.rs:3041
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{name}: its name is longer than 32 letters (save it again with a shorter one)"
msgstr "{name}:它的名称超过 32 个字符(请用更短的名称重新保存)"

#: src/core.rs:3048
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{name}: its pointer paths start in files that differ between computers "
"(graphics driver, Wine, Steam)"
msgstr "{name}:它的指针路径起始于不同电脑上会不同的文件(显卡驱动、Wine、Steam)"

#: src/core.rs:3052
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{name}: its pointer paths aren't confirmed yet (restart the game and check "
"it)"
msgstr "{name}:它的指针路径还没有确认(请重启游戏并检查)"

#: src/core.rs:3054
#, rust-format
msgid "{name}: Ferret has no way to find it that works on other computers"
msgstr "{name}:Ferret 没有能在其他电脑上找到它的方法"

#: src/core.rs:3072
msgid "Nothing is saved for this game yet"
msgstr "这个游戏还没有保存任何数值"

#: src/core.rs:3073
msgid "Nothing to export."
msgstr "没有可导出的内容。"

#: src/core.rs:3102
#, rust-format
msgid "These values are for {theirs}, not {exe}"
msgstr "这些数值属于 {theirs},不是 {exe}"

#: src/core.rs:3107
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"These values are for another game with a program called {exe} (Steam app "
"{theirs}, this one is {ours})"
msgstr ""
"这些数值属于另一个程序名同为 {exe} 的游戏(Steam 应用 {theirs},而这个是 "
"{ours})"

#: src/core.rs:3122
#, rust-format
msgid "{name}: you have it already, as {mine}"
msgstr "{name}：你已经有了，名为 {mine}"

#: src/core.rs:3162
msgid "Nothing imported."
msgstr "没有导入任何内容。"

#: src/core.rs:3185
#, rust-format
msgid "At most ({max}) is lower than at least ({min}): nothing changed"
msgstr "最多({max})小于最少({min}):没有任何更改"

#: src/core.rs:3758
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{name} not written: it was imported and isn't checked yet. If the game shows "
"the number Ferret reads, say so in the Values tab"
msgstr ""
"未写入 {name}:它是导入的,还没有检查。如果游戏显示的数字和 Ferret 读到的一样,"
"请在“数值”标签页中说明"

#: src/core.rs:3780
#, rust-format
msgid "{name} isn't in the game right now (is a save loaded?)"
msgstr "{name} 现在不在游戏中(加载存档了吗?)"

#: src/core.rs:3783
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{name} not written: its name doesn't lead to one value ({why}). Find it "
"again and save it as {name}."
msgstr ""
"未写入 {name}:它的名称没有指向唯一的数值({why})。请重新找到它并保存为 "
"{name}。"

#: src/core.rs:3801
#, rust-format
msgid "{name} can't be found right now (is a save loaded?)"
msgstr "现在找不到 {name}(加载存档了吗?)"

#: src/core.rs:3805
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"not written: {why}, so it could land in the wrong place. Find it again and "
"save it as {name}: that confirms the right path"
msgstr ""
"未写入:{why},所以可能写到错误的位置。请重新找到它并保存为 {name}:这样能确认正"
"确的路径"

#: src/core.rs:3954
msgid "a move of the bar"
msgstr "一次进度条变化"

#: src/core.rs:3955
msgid "a reading while it moved"
msgstr "一次变化中的读取"

#: src/core.rs:3956
msgid "a reading while it stayed still"
msgstr "一次静止时的读取"

#: src/core.rs:3957
msgid "copying the game's memory"
msgstr "复制游戏内存"

#: src/core.rs:3958
#, rust-format
msgid "the search for {n}"
msgstr "搜索 {n}"

#: src/core.rs:3959
#, rust-format
msgid "ruling out {place}"
msgstr "排除 {place}"

#: src/core.rs:3960
#, rust-format
msgid "picking {place}"
msgstr "选择 {place}"

#: src/core.rs:3961
msgid "starting over"
msgstr "重新开始"

#: src/core.rs:4015
msgid "The number is back in the box."
msgstr "数字回到框里了。"

#: src/core.rs:4018
msgid ""
"The box keeps changing: it may take in something that moves or blinks around "
"the number. Pick the number again with a box around its digits only."
msgstr ""
"框里的内容一直在变:可能包含了数字周围会动或闪烁的东西。请重新选择数字,框只框"
"住数字本身。"

#: src/core.rs:4023
msgid ""
"The box doesn't show the number now (it looks different from when you picked "
"it: a menu or the inventory closed?). Ferret waits until it's back."
msgstr ""
"框里现在没有显示数字(和你选择时看起来不一样:菜单或背包关了?)。Ferret 会等它回"
"来。"

#: src/core.rs:4049
msgid ""
"The box is outside the game picture now (the window got smaller?): capture "
"again and pick it again."
msgstr "框现在在游戏画面之外(窗口变小了?):请重新截取画面并重新选择。"

#: src/core.rs:4159
#, rust-format
msgid "saved as {names}"
msgstr "已保存为 {names}"

#: src/core.rs:4183
msgid ""
"Your character isn't in the game right now (a menu or a loading screen?). "
"Try again once you're playing."
msgstr "你的角色现在不在游戏中（菜单或加载画面？）。开始游戏后再试一次。"

#: src/core.rs:4187
msgid ""
"Ferret can list a game's numbers by name only in Unreal Engine, Unity, "
"Godot, GameMaker, RPG Maker MV/MZ, Lua (LuaJIT), Java, Python and Adobe AIR "
"games so far."
msgstr ""
"目前 Ferret 只能在 Unreal Engine、Unity、Godot、GameMaker、RPG Maker MV/MZ、"
"Lua（LuaJIT）、Java、Python 和 Adobe AIR 游戏中按名称列出游戏的数字。"

#: src/core.rs:4265
msgid "This tweak can't be used right now. Is your character in the game?"
msgstr "现在无法使用这项调整。你的角色在游戏中吗？"

#: src/core.rs:4296
msgid "Ferret couldn't find what this tweak changes by its name, so it's off."
msgstr "Ferret 没能通过名称找到这项调整要改的内容，所以它是关闭的。"

#: src/core.rs:4331
#, rust-format
msgid "not a number: {value}"
msgstr "不是数字:{value}"

#: src/core.rs:4350
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"The game put {n} back at once, so that place isn't where it keeps the value: "
"removed it."
msgstr "游戏立刻把 {n} 改了回去,所以数值不在那个位置:已移除。"

#: src/core.rs:4355
msgid "No places are left: press Start Over and search again."
msgstr "没有剩余的位置了:请点击“重新开始”再搜索一次。"

#: src/core.rs:4362
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"It kept {n}. If the game shows it too, press Use This One (some games only "
"redraw a number when they change it themselves)."
msgstr ""
"它保持为 {n}。如果游戏也显示这个数字,请点击“就是这个”(有些游戏只有自己修改数"
"字时才会重绘)。"

#: src/core.rs:4404
msgid ""
"The number is 0, like most of the game's memory: change it in the game and "
"Ferret searches from there."
msgstr ""
"这个数字是 0，游戏内存里几乎全是 0：在游戏里改变它，Ferret 会从新的数字开始搜"
"索。"

#: src/core.rs:4407
msgid "The number stayed at 0. Change it in the game, then search again."
msgstr "数字一直是 0。请在游戏里改变它，然后再搜索。"

#: src/core.rs:4440
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{n} is in too many places in the game's memory to search for: search once "
"the game shows a bigger number."
msgstr ""
"{n} 在游戏内存里出现的地方太多，无法搜索：等游戏显示更大的数字时再搜索。"

#: src/core.rs:4528
#, rust-format
msgid "{place} isn't among the matches any more"
msgstr "{place} 已不在匹配结果中"

#: src/core.rs:4820
msgid ""
"Now change the number in the game once (use some or pick some up): Ferret "
"watches which of the game's code does it, the surest way to find it again. "
"Cancel saves it another way."
msgstr ""
"现在在游戏中改变一次这个数字(用掉一些或捡起一些):Ferret 会观察是游戏的哪段代"
"码修改了它,这是之后再次找到它最可靠的方法。“取消”会用其他方式保存它。"

#: src/core.rs:4852
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Now change the number in the game once (pick some up or use some): Ferret "
"waits and watches which of the {n} place the game carries on from. Stop "
"Waiting lists them to try instead."
msgid_plural ""
"Now change the number in the game once (pick some up or use some): Ferret "
"waits and watches which of the {n} places the game carries on from. Stop "
"Waiting lists them to try instead."
msgstr[0] ""
"现在在游戏中改变一次这个数字(捡起一些或用掉一些):Ferret 会等待并观察游戏从 "
"{n} 个位置中的哪一个继续计数。“停止等待”会改为列出它们供你逐个尝试。"

#: src/core.rs:4984
#, rust-format
msgid "The one place left holds {held}, not the {n} on screen."
msgstr "最后剩下的位置是 {held},不是屏幕上的 {n}。"

#: src/core.rs:5008
msgid "could not read the number"
msgstr "无法读取数字"

#: src/core.rs:5243
msgid "The icons are all empty, hidden or keep changing."
msgstr "图标全是空的、被遮挡了,或者一直在变。"

#: src/core.rs:5244
msgid "The bar is empty, hidden or keeps moving."
msgstr "进度条是空的、被遮挡了,或者一直在动。"

#: src/core.rs:5340
msgid ""
"Stopped before the icons changed. Press Start again and let them change in "
"the game."
msgstr "在图标变化之前停止了。请再次点击“开始”,并让它们在游戏中变化。"

#: src/core.rs:5341
msgid ""
"Stopped before the bar moved. Press Start again and let the bar change in "
"the game."
msgstr "在进度条变化之前停止了。请再次点击“开始”,并让进度条在游戏中变化。"

#: src/core.rs:5374
msgid "The one place left kept a test value, but the icons didn't show it."
msgstr "最后剩下的位置保持了测试值,但图标没有显示出来。"

#: src/core.rs:5375
msgid "The one place left kept a test value, but the bar didn't show it."
msgstr "最后剩下的位置保持了测试值,但进度条没有显示出来。"

#: src/core.rs:5454
msgid ""
"Nothing to narrow down yet: press Start or type the number the game shows."
msgstr "还没有可以缩小的结果:请点击“开始”或输入游戏显示的数字。"

#: src/core.rs:5457
msgid "No number picked: type the number the game shows instead."
msgstr "没有选择数字:请改为输入游戏显示的数字。"

#: src/core.rs:5465
msgid ""
"The icons are all empty, hidden or changing: try again while they show and "
"stay still."
msgstr "图标全是空的、被遮挡了或正在变化:请在它们可见且不动时重试。"

#: src/core.rs:5466
msgid ""
"The bar is empty, hidden or moving: try again while it shows and stays still."
msgstr "进度条是空的、被遮挡了或正在变化:请在它可见且不动时重试。"

#: src/core.rs:5470
msgid ""
"Nothing in the game's memory changed like the icons did. Press Start Over "
"and search again."
msgstr "游戏内存中没有任何东西像图标那样变化。请点击“重新开始”再搜索一次。"

#: src/core.rs:5471
msgid ""
"Nothing in the game's memory moved like the bar did. Press Start Over and "
"search again."
msgstr "游戏内存中没有任何东西像进度条那样变化。请点击“重新开始”再搜索一次。"

#: src/core.rs:5486
msgid "Can't read the number now (is it on screen?). Type it below instead."
msgstr "现在无法读取数字(它在屏幕上吗?)。请在下方输入它。"

#: src/core.rs:5529
msgid "Nothing to compare with yet. Click No Number? first."
msgstr "还没有可比较的内容。请先点击“没有数字?”。"

#: src/core.rs:5546
msgid ""
"The copy of the game's memory is gone. Click No Number? to make a new one."
msgstr "游戏内存的副本已经没有了。点击“没有数字?”重新复制一份。"

#: src/core.rs:5600
msgid ""
"Stopped before anything was narrowed down. Press It's Moving while it "
"changes on its own."
msgstr "在缩小范围前就停止了。在它自己变化时按“在变化”。"

#: src/core.rs:5601
msgid "Ferret only knows that it moved when you said it did."
msgstr "Ferret 只知道它在你说的时候变化了。"

#: src/core.rs:5627
msgid ""
"Almost everything in the game's memory is 0: type the number once the game "
"shows another one."
msgstr "游戏内存里几乎全是 0：等游戏显示别的数字时再输入。"

#: src/core.rs:5642
#, rust-format
msgid "{n} is nowhere in the game's memory"
msgstr "游戏内存中找不到 {n}"

#: src/feedback.rs:157
msgid "Write something first"
msgstr "请先写点什么"

#: src/feedback.rs:162
msgid "Too many reports from here in the last hour: try again later."
msgstr "过去一小时内从这里发送的报告太多了:请稍后再试。"

#: src/feedback.rs:163
msgid "This report is too big to send: leave out the log and try again."
msgstr "这份报告太大,无法发送:请去掉日志后重试。"

#: src/feedback.rs:164
msgid ""
"A report with this id was sent already: close this window and write it again."
msgstr "已经发送过这个编号的报告了:请关闭此窗口重新写一份。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:51
#, rust-format
msgid "Your character ({class})"
msgstr "你的角色（{class}）"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:52
#, rust-format
msgid "Your player's state ({class})"
msgstr "你的玩家状态（{class}）"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:53
#, rust-format
msgid "Your controller ({class})"
msgstr "你的控制器（{class}）"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:54
#, rust-format
msgid "The game ({class})"
msgstr "游戏（{class}）"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:55
#, rust-format
msgid "Your party ({class})"
msgstr "你的队伍（{class}）"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:56
#, rust-format
msgid "Belongs to {owner} ({class})"
msgstr "属于 {owner}（{class}）"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:57
#, rust-format
msgid "Part of {owner} ({class})"
msgstr "{owner} 的一部分（{class}）"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:58
#, rust-format
msgid "Used by {owner} ({class})"
msgstr "由 {owner} 使用（{class}）"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:73
msgid "Look for a name: health, ammo, gold…"
msgstr "查找名称：health、ammo、gold…"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:77
msgid "Only What Changes"
msgstr "只看变化的"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:78
msgid ""
"Turn this on, then change the number in the game: only the numbers that "
"moved stay in the list."
msgstr "打开它，然后在游戏中改变这个数字：列表中只保留变化过的数字。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:82
msgid "Show Everything"
msgstr "显示全部"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:83
msgid ""
"Also the game's inner workings: each ability's settings, the game's own "
"systems, the controller and the settings."
msgstr "还包括游戏的内部机制：每个技能的设置、游戏自身的系统、控制器和设置。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:85
msgid "List Again"
msgstr "重新列出"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:93
msgid ""
"Your character's numbers, by the names the game gives them. Can't tell which "
"one it is? Turn on Only What Changes and change it in the game."
msgstr ""
"你的角色的数字，使用游戏给它们起的名称。不知道是哪一个？打开“只看变化的”，然"
"后在游戏中改变它。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:120
msgid "Tweaks"
msgstr "调整"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:121
msgid ""
"Changes the game's engine understands, one switch each. Save your game "
"before you try one."
msgstr "游戏引擎能理解的改动，每项一个开关。试之前先保存游戏。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:130
msgid "Reading the game's objects…"
msgstr "正在读取游戏的对象…"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:133
msgid "Try Again"
msgstr "重试"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:137
msgid "Nothing to List Yet"
msgstr "暂时没有可列出的内容"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:214
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{about} On, but not all of it is in the game right now: Ferret keeps it once "
"it is."
msgstr "{about} 已开启，但现在游戏里还没有全部内容：一旦出现，Ferret 就会保持它。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:224
msgid "Tweak on: Ferret keeps it while you play"
msgstr "调整已开启：你玩游戏时 Ferret 会保持它"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:225
msgid "Tweak off: the game has its own values back"
msgstr "调整已关闭：游戏恢复了自己的值"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:261
msgid "Ferret found no numbers in your character's objects."
msgstr "Ferret 在你的角色的对象中没有找到数字。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:277 src/gui/browse.rs:438 src/gui/find.rs:369
#: src/gui/guide.rs:77
msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:387
msgid "Nothing changed yet: change the number in the game."
msgstr "还没有变化：请在游戏中改变这个数字。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:388
msgid "No names match."
msgstr "没有匹配的名称。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:390
#, rust-format
msgid "{n} number shown, {more} more with Show Everything"
msgid_plural "{n} numbers shown, {more} more with Show Everything"
msgstr[0] "显示了 {n} 个数字，打开“显示全部”还有 {more} 个"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:396
#, rust-format
msgid "{n} number"
msgid_plural "{n} numbers"
msgstr[0] "{n} 个数字"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:406 src/gui/browse.rs:414
msgid "God Mode"
msgstr "无敌模式"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:407
msgid ""
"Your character can't be damaged the engine's way, and its health stays at "
"the most it has had since you turned this on. Games with damage rules of "
"their own may ignore the first part."
msgstr "你的角色不会以引擎的方式受到伤害，生命值保持在开启后达到过的最高值。有自己伤害规则的游戏可能会忽略第一部分。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:410
msgid "Fly"
msgstr "飞行"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:411
msgid ""
"Your character flies instead of walking or falling. Going up and down "
"depends on the game's controls; turned off, the character falls back down."
msgstr "你的角色会飞，而不是行走或下落。能否上升和下降取决于游戏的操作；关闭后角色会落回地面。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:415
msgid ""
"Your heroes' HP and MP don't go down: they stay at the most they've had "
"since you turned this on, so heal once to keep them full. One hit bigger "
"than a hero's HP can still knock them out."
msgstr "你的英雄的 HP 和 MP 不会下降：它们保持在开启后达到过的最高值，所以治疗一次就能让它们保持满值。比英雄 HP 更高的一击仍然可能把他击倒。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:418
msgid "Walk Through Walls"
msgstr "穿墙"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:419
msgid ""
"You walk through walls, people and water (not off the map). Places the story "
"hasn't opened yet open too."
msgstr "你可以穿过墙壁、人物和水（不会走出地图）。剧情还没开放的地方也会开放。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:421
msgid "No Random Battles"
msgstr "无随机战斗"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:421
msgid ""
"Walking around starts no random battles. Battles the story starts still "
"happen."
msgstr "四处走动不会触发随机战斗。剧情触发的战斗仍会发生。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:422
msgid "Walk Faster"
msgstr "走得更快"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:422
msgid "You walk twice as fast."
msgstr "你走路的速度变为两倍。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:435
#, rust-format
msgid "Save {name}"
msgstr "保存 {name}"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:435
msgid "Ferret finds it again by this name every time you open the game."
msgstr "每次你打开游戏时，Ferret 都会按这个名称再次找到它。"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:438 src/gui/feedback.rs:69 src/gui/find.rs:239
#: src/gui/find.rs:2345 src/gui/guide.rs:162 src/gui/guide.rs:610
#: src/gui/guide.rs:616 src/gui/share.rs:256 src/gui/share.rs:447
#: src/gui/share.rs:475 src/gui/values.rs:144 src/gui/values.rs:175
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

#: src/gui/browse.rs:459 src/gui/find.rs:2311
#, rust-format
msgid "Saved {name}. Ferret finds it again every time you attach."
msgstr "已保存 {name}。每次连接时 Ferret 都会再找到它。"

#: src/gui/feedback.rs:34
msgid "How to Reach You (Optional)"
msgstr "联系方式(可选)"

#: src/gui/feedback.rs:36
msgid "Include Ferret's Log"
msgstr "附上 Ferret 的日志"

#: src/gui/feedback.rs:37
msgid ""
"What Ferret did lately, with your home folder's path taken out. Helps most "
"with bugs."
msgstr "Ferret 最近做了什么,已去掉你主文件夹的路径。对排查错误最有帮助。"

#: src/gui/feedback.rs:41
msgid "Include This Game's Saved Values"
msgstr "附上这个游戏已保存的数值"

#: src/gui/feedback.rs:49
msgid "Show What's Sent"
msgstr "显示要发送的内容"

#: src/gui/feedback.rs:52
msgid ""
"What happened, or what would you like Ferret to do? It goes to Ferret's "
"developer, who reads every one."
msgstr ""
"发生了什么,或者你希望 Ferret 能做什么?它会发给 Ferret 的开发者,每一条都会被阅"
"读。"

#: src/gui/feedback.rs:67 src/gui/feedback.rs:129
msgid "Send"
msgstr "发送"

#: src/gui/feedback.rs:75
msgid "Send Feedback"
msgstr "发送反馈"

#: src/gui/feedback.rs:112
msgid "Sending…"
msgstr "正在发送……"

#: src/gui/feedback.rs:124
msgid "Thanks, It Was Sent"
msgstr "谢谢,已发送"

#: src/gui/feedback.rs:124
msgid "If you write about it somewhere, mention this id:"
msgstr "如果你在别处提到这件事,请附上这个编号:"

#: src/gui/feedback.rs:157
msgid "What's Sent"
msgstr "要发送的内容"

#. Translators: the value types a search looks for, named as in Cheat Engine.
#: src/gui/find.rs:207
msgid "All Types"
msgstr "所有类型"

#: src/gui/find.rs:208
msgid "2 Bytes"
msgstr "2 字节"

#: src/gui/find.rs:209
msgid "4 Bytes"
msgstr "4 字节"

#: src/gui/find.rs:210
msgid "Float"
msgstr "单浮点"

#: src/gui/find.rs:211
msgid "Double"
msgstr "双浮点"

#: src/gui/find.rs:212
msgid "Encoded 4 Bytes"
msgstr "编码的 4 字节"

#: src/gui/find.rs:223
#, rust-format
msgid "Forgot {places}: searches look everywhere"
msgstr "已忘记{places}:搜索会查找所有位置"

#: src/gui/find.rs:231
msgid "Rule Out This Place?"
msgstr "排除这个位置?"

#: src/gui/find.rs:233
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{place} ({kind}, now {value}) is dropped from the matches. Undo brings it "
"back."
msgstr "{place}({kind},当前为 {value})会从匹配结果中移除。“撤销”可以恢复。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:239
msgid "Rule Out"
msgstr "排除"

#: src/gui/find.rs:261
msgid "Click the number you want to change, or drag a box around it"
msgstr "点击你想修改的数字,或在它周围拖出一个框"

#: src/gui/find.rs:281
msgid "Watch the Game's Next Window"
msgstr "观察游戏的下一个窗口"

#: src/gui/find.rs:282
msgid "Pick Another Window…"
msgstr "选择另一个窗口……"

#: src/gui/find.rs:288
msgid "Capture again"
msgstr "重新截取"

#: src/gui/find.rs:289
msgid "Watch another window"
msgstr "观察另一个窗口"

#: src/gui/find.rs:294
msgid ""
"Fit the picture in the window (scroll over it to zoom, drag with the right "
"button to move it)"
msgstr "让画面适应窗口(在画面上滚动可缩放,按住右键拖动可移动)"

#: src/gui/find.rs:300
msgid "What Ferret reads"
msgstr "Ferret 读到的内容"

#: src/gui/find.rs:312
msgid ""
"Forget the picked box, to search for a number the game doesn't show by "
"typing it"
msgstr "忘记已选择的框,以便输入游戏不显示的数字来搜索"

#: src/gui/find.rs:318 src/gui/find.rs:1291 src/gui/find.rs:1314
#: src/gui/find.rs:1582 src/gui/find.rs:1687
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

#: src/gui/find.rs:319
msgid "Start"
msgstr "开始"

#: src/gui/find.rs:321 src/gui/find.rs:1252
msgid "Start Over"
msgstr "重新开始"

#: src/gui/find.rs:322
msgid "Forget the matches so far and search from scratch"
msgstr "忘记目前的匹配结果,从头搜索"

#: src/gui/find.rs:325
msgid "Scan Again"
msgstr "再次扫描"

#: src/gui/find.rs:326
msgid ""
"Keep only the places that hold the number the game shows now, even if it "
"didn't change"
msgstr "只保留存有游戏当前显示数字的位置,即使它没有变化"

#: src/gui/find.rs:331
msgid ""
"Undo the last step of the search: a number, a ruled-out place or Start Over"
msgstr "撤销上一步搜索:一个数字、一个被排除的位置或“重新开始”"

#: src/gui/find.rs:335
msgid "Redo the last step Undo took back"
msgstr "重做被撤销的上一步"

#: src/gui/find.rs:340
msgid ""
"What new searches look for. Fewer types leave fewer places to narrow down."
msgstr "新搜索要查找的类型。类型越少,需要缩小的位置就越少。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:358
msgid "What Ferret is doing"
msgstr "Ferret 正在做什么"

#: src/gui/find.rs:368
msgid "Name it, for example gems"
msgstr "给它起个名字,比如 gems"

#: src/gui/find.rs:382 src/gui/find.rs:422
msgid "Try Them One by One"
msgstr "逐个尝试"

#: src/gui/find.rs:384
msgid "Keep Going"
msgstr "继续"

#: src/gui/find.rs:385
msgid "Change the number in the game again: often the quicker way"
msgstr "在游戏中再改变一次数字:通常更快"

#: src/gui/find.rs:388
msgid "Show the List"
msgstr "显示列表"

#: src/gui/find.rs:399
msgid "The number to write there"
msgstr "要写到那里的数字"

#: src/gui/find.rs:401
msgid "Try It"
msgstr "试一试"

#: src/gui/find.rs:402
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "跳过"

#: src/gui/find.rs:403
msgid "Stop Trying"
msgstr "停止尝试"

#: src/gui/find.rs:411
msgid "No, Next Place"
msgstr "不是,下一个位置"

#: src/gui/find.rs:412
msgid "Yes, That's It"
msgstr "是,就是这个"

#: src/gui/find.rs:420
msgid "It's Still"
msgstr "静止"

#: src/gui/find.rs:421
msgid "It's Moving"
msgstr "在变化"

#: src/gui/find.rs:431
msgid "Can't read it?"
msgstr "读不出来?"

#: src/gui/find.rs:433
msgid "Type the number"
msgstr "输入数字"

#: src/gui/find.rs:438
msgid "Search"
msgstr "搜索"

#: src/gui/find.rs:440
msgid "No Number?"
msgstr "没有数字?"

#: src/gui/find.rs:442
msgid ""
"For a value the game shows no number for, like a ring, a bar or hunger: "
"Ferret copies the game's memory, then you tell it whether the value went up "
"or down"
msgstr ""
"用于游戏不以数字显示的数值,比如圆环、进度条或饥饿度:Ferret 复制游戏内存,然后"
"由你告诉它数值是变大了还是变小了"

#: src/gui/find.rs:447
msgid "More"
msgstr "更多"

#: src/gui/find.rs:448
msgid "Value types, the game's learned digits and the places of earlier finds"
msgstr "数值类型、学到的游戏数字字形和以前找到的位置"

#: src/gui/find.rs:462
msgid "Value types new searches look for:"
msgstr "新搜索要查找的数值类型:"

#: src/gui/find.rs:468
msgid "Learned digits:"
msgstr "已学会的数字:"

#: src/gui/find.rs:474
msgid "Forget Them"
msgstr "忘记它们"

#: src/gui/find.rs:475
msgid "Search everywhere instead, until the next value found"
msgstr "改为在所有位置搜索,直到找到下一个数值"

#: src/gui/find.rs:505
msgid "Already saved for this game:"
msgstr "这个游戏已保存的:"

#: src/gui/find.rs:510
msgid "Show the Game Window"
msgstr "显示游戏窗口"

#: src/gui/find.rs:515
msgid "Type the Number Instead"
msgstr "改为输入数字"

#: src/gui/find.rs:521 src/gui/values.rs:191
msgid "Find a Value"
msgstr "查找数值"

#: src/gui/find.rs:523
msgid ""
"Ferret looks at the game window, you pick the number, and then you just "
"play. Only the game window is captured."
msgstr ""
"Ferret 会查看游戏窗口,你选择数字,然后正常玩游戏即可。只会截取游戏窗口。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:524
msgid ""
"Ferret looks at the game window, you pick the number, and then you just "
"play. Only the game window is captured; the first time, your desktop asks "
"which window to share."
msgstr ""
"Ferret 会查看游戏窗口,你选择数字,然后正常玩游戏即可。只会截取游戏窗口;第一次"
"时,你的桌面会询问要共享哪个窗口。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:543
msgid ""
"Ferret can't tell which of these is the value. Type a new value into one and "
"press Try, then look at the game: if it shows that value, press Use This One."
msgstr ""
"Ferret 无法判断这些中哪个是那个数值。在其中一个中输入新值并点击“试一试”,然后"
"看游戏:如果显示了这个值,就点击“就是这个”。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:640 src/gui/find.rs:644 src/gui/find.rs:1231
#: src/gui/find.rs:1554
msgid "Type the number the game shows"
msgstr "输入游戏显示的数字"

#: src/gui/find.rs:641
msgid ""
"Below the picture. Then change it in the game and type the new one. Ferret "
"learns the game's digits from it."
msgstr ""
"在画面下方。然后在游戏中改变它并输入新的数字。Ferret 会借此学习游戏的数字字"
"形。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:645
msgid ""
"Below the picture. Then change it in the game and type the new one. Click "
"the number in the picture first, and Ferret learns the game's digits from it."
msgstr ""
"在画面下方。然后在游戏中改变它并输入新的数字。先点击画面中的数字,Ferret 就能"
"借此学习游戏的数字字形。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:917
msgid "no number"
msgstr "没有数字"

#: src/gui/find.rs:917
#, rust-format
msgid "reads {n}"
msgstr "读到 {n}"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1021
#, rust-format
msgid "{before} → {n} place matches"
msgid_plural "{before} → {n} places match"
msgstr[0] "{before} → {n} 个位置匹配"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1027
#, rust-format
msgid "Still {n} place matches"
msgid_plural "Still {n} places match"
msgstr[0] "仍有 {n} 个位置匹配"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1028 src/gui/guide.rs:136
#, rust-format
msgid "{n} place matches"
msgid_plural "{n} places match"
msgstr[0] "{n} 个位置匹配"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1048
msgid "The first time, your desktop asks which window to share."
msgstr "第一次时,你的桌面会询问要共享哪个窗口。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1050
msgid "Capturing the game window…"
msgstr "正在截取游戏窗口……"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1066 src/gui/find.rs:1976 src/gui/guide.rs:207
#: src/gui/mod.rs:983
msgid "Click the number you want to find"
msgstr "点击你想查找的数字"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1067
msgid ""
"In the picture of your game below. Or drag a box around it, around a bar, or "
"around a row of icons such as hearts."
msgstr ""
"在下方的游戏画面中。或者在它、进度条或一排图标(比如心形)周围拖出一个框。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1073
msgid "Could not capture the game window"
msgstr "无法截取游戏窗口"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1086
msgid "Reading the number…"
msgstr "正在读取数字……"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1123
#, rust-format
msgid "Reads {n}?"
msgstr "读到的是 {n} 吗?"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1123
msgid "Answer the question first."
msgstr "请先回答问题。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1132
msgid "Those are icons: click Start when you're ready"
msgstr "这些是图标:准备好后点击“开始”"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1133
msgid ""
"Ferret counts the full ones (halves too). Leave them alone until this turns "
"green, then play until the count goes down or up a couple of times."
msgstr ""
"Ferret 会数满的图标(半个也算)。在这里变绿之前不要动它们,然后玩到数量减少或增"
"加几次。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1136
msgid "That's a bar: click Start when you're ready"
msgstr "这是一个进度条:准备好后点击“开始”"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1137
msgid ""
"Ferret goes by how full it is. Leave it alone until this turns green, then "
"play until it goes down or up a couple of times."
msgstr ""
"Ferret 根据它有多满来判断。在这里变绿之前不要动它,然后玩到它减少或增加几次。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1146 src/gui/find.rs:1153
msgid "Can't read a number there"
msgstr "那里读不出数字"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1147
#, rust-format
msgid "Can't measure it as a bar either: {why}"
msgstr "也无法按进度条来测量:{why}"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1154
msgid ""
"Type the number the game shows below; Ferret learns the game's digits from "
"it. Or try a tighter box."
msgstr ""
"请在下方输入游戏显示的数字;Ferret 会借此学习游戏的数字字形。或者试试更紧的"
"框。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1159
msgid "Can't read it"
msgstr "读不出来"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1169
#, rust-format
msgid "Reads {n}: click Start when you're ready"
msgstr "读到 {n}:准备好后点击“开始”"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1170
msgid ""
"Leave the number alone until this turns green. Then play until it changes a "
"couple of times."
msgstr "在这里变绿之前不要动这个数字。然后玩到它变化几次。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1179
msgid "Is This the Number?"
msgstr "是这个数字吗?"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1180
msgid ""
"Compare the picture of your box with what Ferret read. Ferret learns how the "
"game draws its digits from your answer."
msgstr ""
"比较你框选的画面和 Ferret 读到的结果。Ferret 会根据你的回答学习游戏如何绘制数"
"字。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1198
msgid "Your box in the game"
msgstr "你在游戏中的框"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1199
msgid "Ferret reads"
msgstr "Ferret 读到"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1201
msgid "No, I'll Type It"
msgstr "不是,我来输入"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1201 src/gui/values.rs:313
#, rust-format
msgid "Yes, It Shows {n}"
msgstr "是,显示的是 {n}"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1232
msgid ""
"Below the picture; Ferret learns the game's digits from it. Or try a tighter "
"box."
msgstr "在画面下方;Ferret 会借此学习游戏的数字字形。或者试试更紧的框。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1242
msgid "Keep the Matches?"
msgstr "保留匹配结果?"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1244
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"You picked a different number while {n} place still matches the last one. "
"Keep it if this number shows the same value (a total and a stack of it, "
"say); start over if it's another value."
msgid_plural ""
"You picked a different number while {n} places still match the last one. "
"Keep them if this number shows the same value (a total and a stack of it, "
"say); start over if it's another value."
msgstr[0] ""
"你选择了另一个数字,而还有 {n} 个位置与上一个匹配。如果这个数字显示的是同一个"
"数值(比如总数和其中一堆),就保留它们;如果是另一个数值,就重新开始。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1252
msgid "Keep the Match"
msgid_plural "Keep the Matches"
msgstr[0] "保留匹配结果"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1298
msgid "Reading the number on screen…"
msgstr "正在读取屏幕上的数字……"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1299 src/gui/find.rs:1526 src/gui/guide.rs:370
msgid ""
"Don't change the number in the game yet. This turns green when it's your "
"turn."
msgstr "先不要在游戏中改变这个数字。轮到你时这里会变绿。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1328
#, rust-format
msgid "{count}: Ferret can't tell which one it is"
msgstr "{count}:Ferret 无法判断是哪一个"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1329 src/gui/find.rs:2217
msgid ""
"Try them one by one, or Keep Going: let the number change in the game again."
msgstr "逐个尝试,或者继续:让数字在游戏中再变化一次。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1330
msgid ""
"Switch to Ferret to try them, or press Start there and let the number change "
"again."
msgstr "切换到 Ferret 来尝试它们,或者在那里点击“开始”并让数字再变化一次。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1338
msgid "Click Start to go on, and let the number change a few more times."
msgstr "点击“开始”继续,并让数字再变化几次。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1339
msgid ""
"Press Start in Ferret to go on, and let the number change a few more times."
msgstr "在 Ferret 中点击“开始”继续,并让数字再变化几次。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1357
msgid "One place left, but Ferret isn't sure"
msgstr "只剩一个位置,但 Ferret 不确定"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1358
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{why} Try it: Ferret writes a number there and asks whether the game shows "
"it."
msgstr "{why}试试看:Ferret 会往那里写一个数字,并问你游戏是否显示了它。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1359
#, rust-format
msgid "{why} Switch to Ferret to try it."
msgstr "{why}切换到 Ferret 来尝试。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1378
#, rust-format
msgid "It's {name}, saved already"
msgstr "这是 {name},已经保存过了"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1380
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"The place Ferret found is the value you saved as {name}: set it or keep it "
"in range in the Values tab. Save it again only if Ferret lost it after a "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"Ferret 找到的位置就是你保存为 {name} 的数值:可以在“数值”标签页中设置它或让它"
"保持在范围内。只有在重启后 Ferret 找不到它时才需要重新保存。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1383
#, rust-format
msgid "It's {name}, which you saved already."
msgstr "这是你已经保存过的 {name}。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1394
msgid ""
"Ferret changed every place that follows it, and the game changed each one "
"back at once. It probably works this number out from other things (like a "
"rate per second), so changing it won't last. Pick a number the game keeps "
"instead, like a stored amount. If this number is at its highest, use some up "
"and try these places."
msgstr ""
"Ferret 修改了每一个跟着它变化的位置,而游戏立刻把每一个都改了回去。游戏可能是"
"根据其他东西(比如每秒速率)计算出这个数字的,所以修改它不会持久。请改选游戏会保"
"存的数字,比如库存数量。如果这个数字已经是最大值,用掉一些再尝试这些位置。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1402
msgid "The game puts this number back"
msgstr "游戏会把这个数字改回去"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1404
msgid "Changing this number probably won't last. Switch to Ferret to see why."
msgstr "修改这个数字可能不会持久。切换到 Ferret 查看原因。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1417
msgid "The search stopped"
msgstr "搜索已停止"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1443 src/gui/guide.rs:585
msgid "Stop Waiting"
msgstr "停止等待"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1458
msgid "The box keeps changing"
msgstr "框里的内容一直在变"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1459 src/gui/find.rs:1460
msgid ""
"It may take in something that moves or blinks. Pick the number again with a "
"box around its digits only."
msgstr "可能包含了会动或闪烁的东西。请重新选择数字,框只框住数字本身。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1471
msgid "Ferret hit a bug"
msgstr "Ferret 遇到了一个错误"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1490
msgid "Found it!"
msgstr "找到了!"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1491
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"It's at {place}. Give it a name and save it, so Ferret finds it again next "
"time."
msgstr "它在 {place}。给它起个名字并保存,这样 Ferret 下次就能再找到它。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1492
msgid "Switch to Ferret to give it a name and keep it."
msgstr "切换到 Ferret 给它起名并保存。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1510
msgid "Type the number as the game shows it"
msgstr "按游戏显示的样子输入数字"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1510
msgid "For example 1250, 1.5 or 3:17."
msgstr "例如 1250、1.5 或 3:17。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1525
#, rust-format
msgid "Looking for {n}…"
msgstr "正在查找 {n}……"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1533
msgid "Change the number in the game, then type the new one."
msgstr "在游戏中改变这个数字,然后输入新的数字。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1545
msgid "Scanning again with the number on screen…"
msgstr "正在用屏幕上的数字再次扫描……"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1554
msgid "No number is picked in the picture, so Ferret can't read it."
msgstr "画面中没有选择数字,所以 Ferret 无法读取。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1566
msgid "Scanning again…"
msgstr "正在再次扫描……"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1567
msgid ""
"Ferret keeps the places that hold the number on screen now. Don't change it "
"in the game yet."
msgstr "Ferret 会保留存有屏幕上当前数字的位置。先不要在游戏中改变它。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1574
msgid ""
"Press Scan Again whenever the number stays the same, or Start to follow its "
"changes."
msgstr "每当数字保持不变时点击“再次扫描”,或点击“开始”跟踪它的变化。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1633 src/gui/guide.rs:385
msgid "Copying the game's memory"
msgstr "正在复制游戏内存"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1633
msgid "A few seconds."
msgstr "几秒钟。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1645
msgid "Is it moving now?"
msgstr "它现在在变化吗?"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1647
msgid ""
"Press It's Moving while it changes on its own (a ring counting, a bar "
"filling or draining), and It's Still while it doesn't. Ferret reads the game "
"every 2 seconds. The hotkeys work from inside the game (the keyboard button "
"at the top lists them)."
msgstr ""
"在它自己变化时(圆环在计时、进度条在增减)按“在变化”,不变时按“静止”。Ferret 每 "
"2 秒读取一次游戏。快捷键在游戏中也能用(顶部的键盘按钮列出了它们)。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1736
msgid ""
"Try it: Ferret writes a number there, and you see whether the game changes. "
"Or go on with It's Moving and It's Still."
msgstr ""
"试试它:Ferret 往那里写一个数字,你看游戏有没有变化。或者继续用“在变化”和“静"
"止”。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1737
msgid "Try them one by one, or go on with It's Moving and It's Still."
msgstr "逐个试试,或者继续用“在变化”和“静止”。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1738
msgid ""
"Go on with It's Moving and It's Still: every time it starts or stops rules "
"out more."
msgstr "继续用“在变化”和“静止”:每次开始或停止都会排除更多位置。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1747
msgid "Click No Number? in Ferret's Find Value tab first."
msgstr "请先在 Ferret 的“查找数值”标签页中点击“没有数字?”。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1750
msgid "Ferret is still busy with the last one. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Ferret 还在处理上一步。请稍后再试。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1768
#, rust-format
msgid "{d} isn't learned yet"
msgstr "还没有学会 {d}"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1776
#, rust-format
msgid "{n} learned shape of {d}"
msgid_plural "{n} learned shapes of {d}"
msgstr[0] "{d} 已学会 {n} 种字形"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1777
#, rust-format
msgid "Forget {d}"
msgstr "忘记 {d}"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1787
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{n} learned shape of {d}.\n"
"Forget it if it reads numbers wrong,\n"
"then type a number with a {d} to learn it again."
msgid_plural ""
"{n} learned shapes of {d}.\n"
"Forget them if they read numbers wrong,\n"
"then type a number with a {d} to learn it again."
msgstr[0] ""
"{d} 已学会 {n} 种字形。\n"
"如果读错了数字就忘掉它们,\n"
"然后输入一个包含 {d} 的数字来重新学习。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1806
msgid ""
"None yet: the general reader reads the numbers. Confirming or typing the "
"number the game shows teaches Ferret its digits."
msgstr ""
"还没有:由通用识别器读取数字。确认或输入游戏显示的数字,可以教 Ferret 学会它的"
"数字字形。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1807
msgid "All ten: Ferret reads the game's numbers with these first."
msgstr "全部十个:Ferret 会优先用这些读取游戏的数字。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1809
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Missing {digits}: the general reader fills in. Type a number that has it "
"once."
msgid_plural ""
"Missing {digits}: the general reader fills in. Type a number that has them "
"once."
msgstr[0] "缺少 {digits}:由通用识别器补上。输入一个各含一次这些数字的数。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1820
msgid "Stopping…"
msgstr "正在停止……"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1820
msgid "Ferret puts back any test values it wrote first."
msgstr "Ferret 会先把它写入的测试值改回去。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1833
msgid "Pick the number in Ferret's Find Value tab first."
msgstr "请先在 Ferret 的“查找数值”标签页中选择数字。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1841
msgid ""
"Scan Again works once a search has places to check and a number is picked or "
"typed."
msgstr "当搜索有待检查的位置,并且已选择或输入了数字时,“再次扫描”才能使用。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1858 src/gui/find.rs:1859
msgid "Starting over"
msgstr "重新开始"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1858
msgid "Click Start, or type the number the game shows."
msgstr "点击“开始”,或输入游戏显示的数字。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1859
msgid "Click a number in the picture, or type the number the game shows."
msgstr "点击画面中的一个数字,或输入游戏显示的数字。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1891
msgid "No matches yet. Click Start, or type the number the game shows."
msgstr "还没有匹配结果。点击“开始”,或输入游戏显示的数字。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1893
#, rust-format
msgid "{n} place matches. Click Start, or type the number the game shows."
msgid_plural ""
"{n} places match. Click Start, or type the number the game shows."
msgstr[0] "{n} 个位置匹配。点击“开始”,或输入游戏显示的数字。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1900
#, rust-format
msgid "Redid {step}"
msgstr "已重做:{step}"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1901
#, rust-format
msgid "Undid {step}"
msgstr "已撤销:{step}"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1930
msgid "Capturing the game's next window…"
msgstr "正在截取游戏的下一个窗口……"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1931
msgid "Pick the game window in your desktop's window picker…"
msgstr "请在桌面的窗口选择器中选择游戏窗口……"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1949
msgid "No box picked"
msgstr "没有选择框"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1949
msgid "Type the number the game holds below, or click one in the picture."
msgstr "请在下方输入游戏中的数字,或点击画面中的一个数字。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:1976 src/gui/guide.rs:207 src/gui/mod.rs:983
msgid "In the picture of your game below, or drag a box around it."
msgstr "在下方的游戏画面中,或者在它周围拖出一个框。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2021 src/gui/values.rs:478
msgid "New value"
msgstr "新值"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2022
msgid "Try"
msgstr "试一试"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2023
msgid "Use This One"
msgstr "就是这个"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2044
msgid "Not this one"
msgstr "不是这个"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2086
#, rust-format
msgid "Does the game show {v} now?"
msgstr "游戏现在显示 {v} 了吗?"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2088
msgid ""
"Look at it in the game. Some games only redraw a number when they change it "
"themselves: if it still shows the old number, change it in the game once and "
"look again."
msgstr ""
"看看游戏。有些游戏只有自己修改数字时才会重绘:如果还显示旧数字,就在游戏中改变"
"一次再看。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2127
#, rust-format
msgid "The place didn't show it"
msgid_plural "None of the {n} places showed it"
msgstr[0] "{n} 个位置都没有显示"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2131
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{n} place still matches. Some games only redraw a number when they change it "
"themselves: try it again, or Keep Going and let the number change in the "
"game again."
msgid_plural ""
"{n} places still match. Some games only redraw a number when they change it "
"themselves: try them again, or Keep Going and let the number change in the "
"game again."
msgstr[0] ""
"仍有 {n} 个位置匹配。有些游戏只有自己修改数字时才会重绘:再试一次,或者继续并让"
"数字在游戏中再变化一次。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2147
#, rust-format
msgid "Place {i} of {n}: try a number there"
msgstr "第 {i} 个位置(共 {n} 个):在那里试一个数字"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2151
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"It holds {value} now ({what}). Ferret writes the number you try there and "
"asks whether the game shows it."
msgstr ""
"它现在是 {value}({what})。Ferret 会把你要试的数字写到那里,并问你游戏是否显示"
"了它。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2175
msgid "Type the number to write there, for example 500."
msgstr "输入要写到那里的数字,例如 500。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2181
#, rust-format
msgid "Trying {v} at place {i}"
msgstr "正在第 {i} 个位置试 {v}"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2182
msgid ""
"Ferret checks that the game keeps it. If the game puts its own number back "
"at once, that place isn't it."
msgstr ""
"Ferret 会检查游戏是否保留它。如果游戏立刻改回自己的数字,就不是那个位置。"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2196
msgid "Taking it…"
msgstr "正在选取……"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2201
msgid "Putting its old number back…"
msgstr "正在恢复原来的数字……"

#: src/gui/find.rs:2216
