#: src/gui/values.rs:689
msgid "More Like This"
msgstr "更多同类"

#: src/gui/values.rs:690
msgid ""
"The game's other values of this kind, like your other powers or other units: "
"Ferret finds them through the code that changes this one while you use them."
msgstr ""
"游戏中同类的其他数值,比如你的其他能力或其他单位:在你使用它们时,Ferret 通过改"
"变这个数值的代码找到它们。"

#: src/library.rs:74
